clueweb09-en0010-56-38719.0 [landscape design logo] | Resource Directory Home DIY Landscaping / Garden Fences Fences can have much more purpose in landscape design than just boundaries. While privacy, noise screening, vision screening, and boundaries is generally the purpose of a fence, it can also create different rooms, be a divider, a focal point, decor, etc. As dividers or screens in landscape design, fences are often used free standing without either or one end attached to an endpoint. This in itself can create a new secluded "room" in otherwise open unused space. This type of fence can also be used to simply hang
